WEBVTT

00:16:29.307 --> 00:16:32.155
How is this affecting you?
How can I help?"

00:16:32.179 --> 00:16:33.600
That's pretty simple.

00:16:33.624 --> 00:16:36.030
You might decide it's something
I can't help with,

00:16:36.054 --> 00:16:38.117
but you'd better darn sure
pick up the phone

00:16:38.141 --> 00:16:40.029
and start feeling out the environment

00:16:40.053 --> 00:16:43.238
in your employee base,
in your peers, in your leaders,

00:16:43.262 --> 00:16:47.460
because the time is now,
and so I don't give them an out.

00:16:47.484 --> 00:16:51.431
I actually try and push them
over the edge,

00:16:51.455 --> 00:16:54.975
because sometimes they are
just kind of stuck, like, "What do I do?"

00:16:54.999 --> 00:16:58.613
And then the other thing
that I personally have to do

00:16:58.637 --> 00:17:00.397
is to make sure that they understand